Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:07.00,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,It truly was a wonderful journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:18.51,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,We made it in time...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.51,0:00:22.38,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,Now we can finally head to Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:28.16,Helvetica,,0,0,2,,{\fs22}Since we've been through so much,\Nwe ended up taking quite a long detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:24.52,Helvetica,,0,0,410,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:26.89,Helvetica,,0,0,410,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.89,0:00:27.26,Helvetica,,0,0,410,,Yeah, {\fs25}yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:27.66,Helvetica,,0,0,410,,Yeah, {\fs25}yeah, {\fs20}yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:33.66,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,You've done well, Edward Elric. Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:40.14,Helvetica,,0,0,2,,{\fs22}"Excellent work" is all well and good, but how come not a single person came to see us off?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:43.97,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,Everyone at Eastern Command is also busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:49.91,Helvetica,,0,0,2,,{\fs22}As for Lord Arlen, he went back to the old town of Siam-Sid afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:51.41,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,To Siam-Sid?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:55.53,Helvetica,,0,0,2,,{\fs22}He insists on spending the rest of his life there and won't listen otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:01:02.42,Helvetica,,0,0,2,,{\fs22}But there are still things that must be investigated, so civilians are prohibited from entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.32,0:01:02.42,Helvetica,,0,0,410,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:08.26,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,Are you thinking about Mr. Crowley again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:13.60,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,{\fs28.3}After all, maybe we're no different from Mr. Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:20.68,Helvetica,,0,0,2,,{\fs22}If we had taken one wrong step,\Nwe could have ended up like Mr. Crowley...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.14,0:01:20.68,Helvetica,,0,0,410,,We won’t make that mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.68,0:01:31.52,Helvetica,,0,0,2,,{\fs22}We would not take that wrong step.\NWe will never sacrifice anyone else for our own sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:33.06,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.06,0:01:39.29,Helvetica,,0,0,2,,{\fs22}Sacrificing others for your own happiness isn't an equivalent exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.29,0:01:42.93,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,That's why we'll take our own different path...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:45.20,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,W-What is it, Officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:51.07,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,{\fs21.8}You seem to have grown greatly through this incident, Edward Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.07,0:01:55.04,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Grown greatly?
